			<h5 style="text-align:center;">Golden Angel Tree Program of Oconee County</h5>
			<div class="py-5"></div>
			<p style="text-align:center;">Holidays can be very lonely times for vulnerable adults who have no family support. The Salvation Army&nbsp;is here to give hope to seniors struggling during this time. We provide Christmas gifts, coats and shoes to vulnerable adults through partnerships with local county agencies who identify those needs.</p>
			<p style="text-align:center;">If you would like to help support vulnerable adults in our communities during the Christmas season, please click on the button below to get more details on how you can help.&nbsp; Or you can Donate Now to support this program financially</p>
			<div class="my-2"></div>
			<div class="row my-3">
				<div class="col-md-6 col-sm-12">
					<div class="pvlRichtext cta-button-group d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 my-3 justify-content-center" style="text-align:center"><p style="text-align:center;" class="cta-button-group d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 my-3 justify-content-center"><a href="https://s3.amazonaws.com/uss-cache.salvationarmy.org/9cbac0d2-70e2-45a8-b4c6-82bf4ff458cc_Be+a+Wish+Maker+GOLDEN+COMBINED.pdf" class="btn btn-secondary gap-1 mt-2">More Details</a></p></div>
